--! A platform layered on another (`docs/design/boundary.md` §9.1). Its
--! manifest declares no output key: `program` and `runtime` are `base`'s,
--! inherited because the chain is read top first and the first package to
--! declare a key gives it. It re-exports `Base`, so a program built for it
--! imports `Base.Program` by its own name; `base`'s `Hidden` it does not
--! re-export, so no program can import that.

import Base
import Hidden


--| A program that writes `line`, shouted.
pub shout : String -> Base.Program
shout line =
    Base.say (Hidden.loud line)
